            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone] foe within your reach Stands.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You have ways of keeping your foes down. Attempt an @Check[athletics|defense:fortitude] check against the triggering foe's Fortitude DC. On a success, the action is disrupted, causing the creature to remain prone. On a critical success, the creature also can't Stand until its next turn.</p>"
